             no other modification.

If Serene Village is ever used, keep this TASL statement and the changes note;
the purchased Modern Interiors / Modern User Interface packs still must not be
described as CC-BY.

Generators are tools, not shipped art
-------------------------------------
The two applications used as art sources are **tools only and are not shipped,
modified, or redistributed** by Qubit:

* Character Generator 2.0 — art: LimeZu's official character generator,
  included with the complete pack; the tool is GPLv3 upstream.
* Portrait Generator 1.5.0 — a Gray Matter Studios application; art: LimeZu;
  no licence file is present in the archive.

The build reads their archives in memory. A shared theme is the recipe only; it
does not carry the tool or the art.

Credit placement
----------------
The office shell always shows a persistent Credits/About line
(`Office art: LimeZu — https://limezu.itch.io`), independent of whether a theme
is active. The active theme's own credit line is additional, never the only
credit.

Not used
--------
The free LimeZu pack is non-commercial only and is not used by Qubit Office.

